# fzk: other-player prop widths (PLO_OTHERPLPROPS 8) on Windows clients, props 74-90 at c/s/str/i5.
# One fresh fake player per test: created at (26,26) on the current level {LV}, then [tested prop][X=36 canary].
# Shot after each; the nick label tells where it is. Then the player is moved to another level so it disappears.
